    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41270" root="هلب" body-key="h">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَهْلُوبٌ</span></b>  (S, A, L, Msb) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُهَلَّبٌ</span></b>  (TA) A
horse <i>having his tail shorn:</i> (Msb:) <i>having the
hair of his tail utterly removed:</i> (L:) <i>having his</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُلْب</span> [or <i>coarse hair, of the tail &amp;c.,</i>] <i>shorn:</i>
(A:) <i>having his</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هلب</span> <i>plucked out.</i> (S, TA.)

